# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#   ≤72 chars · imperative mood · no trailing period
#
# <body>
#   What changed and why. Not how — the diff shows how.
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what changed, and what to change it to>
# Refs: #<issue>
#
# ── types ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat      new capability                            minor
#   fix       bug fix                                   patch
#   perf      faster, same behaviour                    patch
#   refactor  no behaviour change                       —
#   docs      documentation only                        —
#   test      tests only                                —
#   build     build system, dependencies                —
#   ci        workflows                                 —
#   chore     everything else                           —
#   revert    reverts a previous commit                 matches
#
# ── scopes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   core svelte react vue docs repo deps
#
# Add `!` before the colon for a breaking change: feat(core)!: …
